# The acceptance build must not even receive legacy state or credentials.
*
!Dockerfile.core
!requirements-core.txt
!domain_utils.py
!source_domains.py
!tgtc_core/
!tgtc_core/**
# The frozen Challenger copy renderer, and ONLY the one static file it reads.
# A Challenger campaign body is nothing but the rendered variables plus the
# signature, so the image cannot build a sendable Challenger lead without these.
# `data/` is re-emptied immediately afterwards so no other data file rides along:
# the last matching pattern wins, so the order of these four lines matters.
!outbound_wave1/
!outbound_wave1/**
!data/
data/*
!data/wave1_claims.json
tgtc_core/testing/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.env
**/.env.*
